  "html": "<div id=\"step-q325131\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 18</div><div class=\"questionWidget-calculatorIcon\"><svg enable-background=\"new 0 0 128 128\" viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"m102.11.5h-76.22c-5.75 0-10.43 4.68-10.43 10.43v106.14c0 5.75 4.68 10.43 10.43 10.43h76.22c5.75 0 10.43-4.68 10.43-10.43v-106.14c0-5.75-4.68-10.43-10.43-10.43zm6.43 116.57c0 3.55-2.88 6.43-6.43 6.43h-76.22c-3.55 0-6.43-2.88-6.43-6.43v-106.14c0-3.55 2.88-6.43 6.43-6.43h76.22c3.55 0 6.43 2.88 6.43 6.43z\"></path><path d=\"m93.96 12.83h-59.92c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v16.57c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h59.92c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-16.57c0-2.76-2.25-5-5-5zm1 21.57c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-59.92c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-16.57c0-.55.45-1 1-1h59.92c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m43.86 45.14h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m68.91 45.14h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m93.96 45.14h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.25-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m43.86 70.7h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m68.91 70.7h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m43.86 96.26h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m68.91 96.26h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m93.96 70.7h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v35.38c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-35.38c0-2.76-2.25-5-5-5zm1 40.38c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-35.38c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path></g></svg></div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>The weekly exercise time for a community is normally distributed with a mean of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"534\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D707 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>μ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> minutes and a standard deviation of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"535\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> minutes. Additionally, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"536\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of people exercise between <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"537\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D707 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.9</mn><mi>μ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> minutes and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"538\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D707 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1.1</mn><mi>μ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> minutes each week. Find the percentage of people who exercise less than <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"539\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>220</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> minutes per week. <strong>Round your answer to two decimal places.</strong></p>\n<p><em>Hint: A table of values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"540\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A6\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> for different values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"541\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is given below, where <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"542\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A6\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the cumulative distribution function for the standard normal distribution. </em></p>\n<table rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"5\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto;\">\n<tbody><tr> \n <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\" width=\"15%\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"543\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></th>\n <td style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"544\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"m